        "original_id": "394c0174-a9a4-5c48-a99e-fbf311b0c7eb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Gordon Green, Larry Hagman, Caroline Grace Cassidy\n- Characters: J. R. Ewing, Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson\n- Works: Your Highness, Dallas, I Dream of Jeannie\n\nFacts:\n- Larry Hagman was born on September 21, 1931, and he was an American film and television actor, director, and producer.\n- David Gordon Green was born on April 9, 1975, and he is an American filmmaker.\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson in the 1960s sitcom \"I Dream of Jeannie.\"\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing J. R. Ewing in the 1980s primetime television soap opera \"Dallas.\"\n- Larry Hagman portrayed J. R. Ewing from the \"Dallas\" series premiere in 1978 until Hagman's death in late 2012.\n- Larry Hagman was the only actor who appeared in all 357 episodes of the original \"Dallas\" series.\n- Larry Hagman died on November 23, 2012.\n- Caroline Grace Cassidy is best known for her role in David Gordon Green's \"Your Highness.\"",
